t, so manage your money wisely.<br>But beware\u2026 if you decide to be the traitor, the <strong>fake evidence awaits you on the Red Chair</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/01eb06dfb9115d4d2fd525fb5d3f8391.poster.avif?t=1759396029\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/01eb06dfb9115d4d2fd525fb5d3f8391.webm?t=1759396029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/01eb06dfb9115d4d2fd525fb5d3f8391.mp4?t=1759396029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Analyze the Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case file comes with evidence collected from the scene. Your task is to carefully examine it in search of the truth.<br>But remember: results may not always be accurate, as your teammates could sabotage them.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/1365f852b4b361c01a1ec48ae0eedcd7.poster.avif?t=1759396029\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/1365f852b4b361c01a1ec48ae0eedcd7.webm?t=1759396029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/extras/1365f852b4b361c01a1ec48ae0eedcd7.mp4?t=1759396029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Careful!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you choose to be the traitor \u2014 and it\u2019s great fun \u2014 you must be careful. Even the slightest suspicion could lead your friends to vote and bind you.<br>You won\u2019t be able to leave the Red Chair. With tape over your mouth, you can only whisper to persuade them\u2026 and that\u2019s no easy task.</p>","developers":["Tink Team Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000360/15c786800f4f8ae6256f093b2b1714ff78bf5648/header.jpg?t=1759396029","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Tink Team Ltd. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nRed Chair is a trademark of Tink Team Ltd.<br />\r\nUnity and Steam are trademarks of their respective owners.<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4000360/1066093553/ed1747c8c527a28ff6cf38005e838ae23c3f6610/1758720430/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758721471","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4000360/1066093553/ed1747c8c527a28ff6cf38005e838ae23c3f6610/1758720430/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758721471","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4000360/1066093553/ed1747c8c527a28ff6cf38005e838ae23c3f6610/1758720430/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758721471","id":257192288,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192288/movie480.mp4?t=1758721471","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192288/movie_max.mp4?t=1758721471"},"name":"Red Chair","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192288/ede06a215943748e864d28fea4c849c91e7d4449/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758721471","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192288/m